WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.320
She’s been stabbed in the chest!

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.480
Is she breathing?!

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.860
Mizue!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.110
Who are you?!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.910
Identify yourself!

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.200
You look suspicious!

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.990
I suppose you’re right to call me suspicious.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.210
If we don’t set up more
barriers in the back rooms

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:29.090
it’ll become dangerous.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.130
it’ll become dangerous.

