<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:46.040
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.250
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.250
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.470
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.470
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:58.140 --> 00:01:59.930
Huh?

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.390
Hey!

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.230
Medicine seller!

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.980
Today’s the young lady’s wedding day.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.940
You won’t be able to sell any medicine.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.880
Look, a medicine seller is coming.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:33.970
Yeah, it’s a medicine seller.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:35.680
It’s a medicine seller, all right.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:36.840
Kayo!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.680
How long are you going to take?!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:38.680
Coming.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.060
I’m almost ready.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.850
Honestly! Of all days!

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:51.530
Oh, my! A delivery?

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.240
Did we order something?

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.650
No, I’m a medicine seller.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.410
Wait, look, this isn’t a good time.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.490
I mean...

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.910
Because of the wedding ceremony?

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:05.750
Yes. Exactly.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.880
Lady Mao is being
married into the Shiono clan.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:11.960
Oh, well...

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.680
I guess it doesn’t concern
the likes of us servants.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.100
Their escort should be
arriving in half an hour.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.430
It’s so bright.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.430
Sasaoka...

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:24.430
Yes?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.060
Close the shoji screens.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.190
But my lady, it’ll shut out the breeze.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:30.400
That doesn’t matter.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.280
It will only be for a short time.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.360
Right away.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.910
A wedding, huh?

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.160
That makes it even better.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:40.740
Huh?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.200
I have the perfect medicine for a bride.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.540
Wow! Let me see!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.590
Oh, my!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:54.590
Also...

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.090
There’s this.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.930
Who the hell are you?!

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.550
Get out of here!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:04.100
People like you aren’t welcome here!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.220
Right, Kayo?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.100
If you want some water, get it yourself.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:10.150
Well, I... I just-

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:10.690
Well, I... I just-

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.730
If you don’t hurry back to your post,

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.400
you’ll hear it from Master Katsuyama again!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.910
You don’t have to be so cruel.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.790
You’d better get out of here,
or I’ll throw you out myself!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:33.750
Damn it!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.710
What a pervert.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.920
I hate him!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.470
That’s pretty harsh.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:42.470
But he’s always trying to touch me.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.060
Anyway, let’s see some stuff...

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.560
All right.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:48.680
Just a moment.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.070
There’re so many!

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.940
This one here’s for...

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.400
And this one here...

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:01.740
No way!

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.990
You should sell these to Lady Mao.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.160
You know what?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.330
The groom, Lord Shiono is...

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.500
See?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.790
That’s unfortunate for the bride.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.250
But what can she do?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.470
I mean, the Shiono family
will be assuming our debts.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.890
You’ll be leaving shortly.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:26.890
Father...

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:28.890
Mother...

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.060
Be sure to treat your
new parents with respect.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:32.980
Yes.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:36.520
And take good care of yourself.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.280
Yes.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.780
You don’t say.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:42.030
Sure, Lord Yoshiaki is a good man and all,

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:45.370
but he’s not good when it comes to money.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:49.540
And he sure seems to be
under Lady Mizue’s thumb.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:52.750
And don’t get me started on Lord Yoshikuni.

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:57.040
Why do you think the younger
Lord Yoshiaki took over the house?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.630
I get the picture.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.590
I better stop talking or I’ll
get scolded by that Sato again.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:08.140
Let me show you something
good in return for letting me in.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:09.560
I can’t wait!

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.480
It’s just a rat.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.400
That scared me!

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.560
Come to think of it,

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.480
there seem to be a lot of rat traps around.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.820
Lots of rats here.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.870
Why not just get a cat?

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:26.950
A cat?

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.080
I suppose.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.910
But somebody here can’t stand them.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.080
Kayo!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.960
I’ve just spoken with Yahei.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.210
How could you be
goofing off at a time like this?!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.840
He told on me, that snitch...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.840
I was just recommending some rat poison...

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.550
We’re not interested!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.680
Kayo...

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.760
Go and fetch some water.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.180
The water jar is completely empty.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.600
All right!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.480
Honestly!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.690
I apologize for causing trouble.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:00.570
I’ll be

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.200
Ieaving shortly.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.370
My Lord. Lady Mao.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:13.790
The escort has arrived.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.420
Grandfather...

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:21.670
Sorry, dear. I hope you’re treated well.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.920
Uncle...

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:23.970
Do your bit.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:27.010
The fate of the Sakai family is in your hands.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:29.970
What’s taking Sato so long?!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.140
Now, of all times!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.310
Mao, it’s time to go.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.390
By the way,

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:39.940
who’s the one that dislikes cats?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.670
W-Why do you ask?

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:05.880
Never mind.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.730
What the hell?!

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:25.860
Rats...

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:30.780
Rats are a good omen for fertility.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.450
They will follow you to your new home.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.620
Yes!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:35.660
Indeed!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.970
It is that effective?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.240
She’s been stabbed in the chest! Mao!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.740
Someone help! Is no one here?!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.740
Is she breathing?!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.950
Lady Mao!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.950
No, she isn’t!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.910
Damn it! Where’s the intruder?!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.170
This is not the work of an intruder.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:25.960
Moreover, you can’t kill
this enemy with a sword.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.590
Who are you?!

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:28.880
How did you get in here?!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.970
K-Kayo let him in!

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:31.760
I...

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.140
You look suspicious!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.140
I mean...

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.930
I suppose you’re right to call me suspicious.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.850
We can’t leave it like this.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.400
If we don’t set up more
barriers in the back rooms...

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.270
it’ll become dangerous.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.270
Barriers?!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.440
it’ll become dangerous.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.440
What nonsense are you on about?!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.940
Enough, Odajima!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.740
Get a doctor, quick!

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:50.690
Hey!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.320
She’s stopped breathing, right?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.370
We need a monk rather than a doctor.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.490
Right? Don’t you think?

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:59.660
Yoshikuni!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.040
You, over there...

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.040
It’s your fault that this happened!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:07.380
What do you know?

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.380
Please calm down, my lady!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:11.050
Nothing yet.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:11.050
Yoshikuni! Yoshikuni!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:12.420
Nothing yet, huh?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.890
How convenient.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.890
It’s all your fault!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.480
Mao!

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.200
Don’t move.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:39.410
If you try escaping like before...

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:43.620
At least let me set up seals
for spiritual protection in the back.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.170
Seals?!

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:49.710
If you let me set up a barrier now,
we may still be able to prevent it.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.090
Shut up! Shut up!

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:53.380
You’re only saying that
so you can try to escape!

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.930
Why not tie him up more tightly?

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.720
This fellow has some strange physical abilities.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.390
You’re going to break my arm.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.600
Good! You deserve it!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.100
Did we check his belongings?

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.520
Lady Mao might have been poisoned...

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.520
Hang on a minute.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.980
Didn’t you say she was stabbed?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.980
Hey! Where are his belongings?!

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.030
Here it is!

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.030
Open it!

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:12.860
Yes, sir!

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.740
What is this medicine?

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:18.620
Various types. There’s no poison.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.870
Various types, huh?

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.490
What is this thing?

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.330
Just a kid’s toy.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.010
This is the last piece.

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.850
What’s this box?

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:43.180
Move!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.730
It’s pretty heavy.

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.690
Hey!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.400
What’s with this sword?!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.990
Why does a medicine seller possess a sword?!

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.500
For killing, of course.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.040
What?!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.340
For cutting down...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.690
Mononoke.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:34.980
For cutting down Mononoke.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.570
For cutting down Mononoke.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.030
Y-You insolent fool!

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.030
Lady Mizue...

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:39.950
Still talking that nonsense!

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:42.950
What Mononoke?! How dare you!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:46.080
What’s the trick to this?

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.960
There’s no trick.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:49.670
No hidden mechanism either.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:53.170
Can you unsheathe it?

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.630
It’s not yet possible.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:57.340
“Not yet” again, huh?

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:00.930
One must first know the “Form”,

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.470
the “Truth” and the “Regret” of the Mononoke

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.890
to unsheathe the sword.

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:07.310
You’re an interesting man.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:08.980
Not at all.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.400
There’s nothing remarkable about me.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.440
I can’t stand this anymore!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.900
To the guardhouse with him!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:17.070
Wait! You can’t do that.

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:18.940
We can’t let this get out.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.320
Master Katsuyama!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.870
This matter is of great concern to our house.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.040
Lady Mizue...

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.290
Lady Mizue...

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.750
Lady Mizue!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.290
Hey, get the doctor.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.080
Yahei!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.080
Sir!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.090
Call Dr. Tsubouchi to the house.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.670
Right away, sir!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.340
Hold it, Yahei...

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.300
You’d better not step outside.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.470
The barriers aren’t complete.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.470
Shut up! Enough!

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:45.800
Listen, don’t say anything unnecessary.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.640
Just tell him Lady Mizue is feeling ill,

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.180
and bring him here.

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:52.140
Yes!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:58.980
Send a messenger to the Shiono family as well.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.570
My Lord, it’s still too early for that.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:03.910
Why?

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:07.660
What would they think if they
learned of Lady Mao’s sudden death?

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:11.500
Even worse, what if the Lord
were to find out what happened?

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:15.080
It would be better to buy some time
by saying she has suddenly taken ill.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.670
Forgive my impudence, Master Katsuyama...

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.380
What is it?!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.930
Concealing the truth might
lead to further complications.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:24.130
What?!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.050
We cannot control what people will say.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:30.930
Is it worth hiding the truth
only to complicate matters?

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.180
But we have to!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.850
Can’t you see that?

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.900
I’m afraid I disagree with you.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.860
Best to be honest and seek help
not only from the Shiono clan,

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:40.360
but from everyone.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:43.320
Had we always been honest, the Shiono...

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.860
I know what you’re plotting.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.700
Why don’t you come out with it?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.540
I’m merely concerned for you.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:53.330
If you’re saying this is some
plot then Master Katsuyama,

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:57.130
do make clear what it is that I’m plotting.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:59.380
I won’t fall for that!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.840
Um...

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.090
I’m here to light the candles...

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.470
Kayo...

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:11.060
Go and light some candles
around Lady Mao as well.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.640
What?! Now, get going!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.730
But, the body...

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.400
What about it?!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.190
You’d better not think of disobeying me!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.610
Hurry up and do it!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.370
I’ll go with you.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:37.960
Elder master...

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:38.920
Yes?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.170
May we light the candles?

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.300
You may enter.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:44.550
Forgive my intrusion.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.640
Master Odajima?

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.180
What is it?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.650
Do you really think this
is the work of Mononoke?

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.770
Don’t be silly.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.030
They don’t exist.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:04.360
Don’t you worry.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:06.950
I’ll catch the culprit in no time.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:11.620
Okay.

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:33.180
M-Master Odajima?!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.980
It was nothing.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.350
Forgive me.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.690
Hey.

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:45.400
Did you hear something?

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:49.780
No, nothing at all.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.340
I-It’s just you, Odajima!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.640
Don’t frighten us.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.390
What’s the matter?

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:16.640
Nothing.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.690
Is Yahei back yet?

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.360
Why is he taking so long?

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:30.780
The doctor probably has

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:31.490
many things to tend to.

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.450
Our problem is serious!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.660
I don’t care about his other matters!

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.160
Serious?

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.870
But it was you who said not
to suggest anything was serious.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.670
Well, in any case,

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.170
he’s taking too long!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.050
Odajima.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.460
Did you see anything?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.130
What do you mean, sir?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.260
A cat.

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:55.930
There are no cats here.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.570
This is the missing servant.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.370
Yahei! How did he...?!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.120
W-Where did he come from?

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:22.910
It’s coming!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.590
You!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:39.560
Do not get in my way.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:44.690
Where are the others?!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.070
Someone else is here! Where?!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.830
The elder master and
Lady Mao are in the back room!

00:18:58.830 --> 00:18:59.910
Hey, wait!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.830
Wait!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.000
What is it?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.880
It’s dangerous to be alone.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.090
You’re better off with the others.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.800
How dare you speak that way!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:14.800
Vanish!

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:31.980
It’s alright.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.150
It cannot enter.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:34.150
“It”?

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:48.080
I don’t know what tricks you’re playing,

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.130
but I’ll get to the bottom of this!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.140
Its presence has faded.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.770
What was that?!

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:08.190
I couldn’t make out its form.

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:09.690
I’ve told you already.

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:11.650
It’s a Mononoke.

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:14.360
If you step beyond the
barrier, you’ll fall prey to it.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.950
But the barrier won’t hold forever.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.070
If we leave it as is

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.700
we’ll end up like them.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.000
Mononoke must be cut down.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.080
But in order to unsheathe
the Sword of Exorcism,

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.750
the conditions must be met.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.670
Form, Truth, and Regret

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:33.170
must be displayed to the sword.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.710
First, the Form.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.050
Fur?

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:39.760
It’s a Ghost Cat.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.850
The intertwined fates of men

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.520
give the Mononoke its Form,

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:58.700
And so, I'll ask you all to tell me

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.330
the Truth and Regret!

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.040
Oh, hold on a moment.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.040
<b><i>To be continued</i></b>

